  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "sentence": "Using the factorization \\(a^4 + 4b^4 = (a^2 + 2ab + 2b^2)(a^2 - 2ab + 2b^2)\\) with \\(a = n\\) and \\(b = 1\\), we get: \\[\nn^4 + 4 = (n^2 + 2n + 2)(n^2 - 2n + 2)\n\\]",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "sentence": "This allows us to rewrite the general term of the series as: \\[\n\\frac{n}{(n^2 + 2n + 2)(n^2 - 2n + 2)}\n\\]",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
