  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "sentence": "Using partial fractions, we decompose this into: \\[\n\\frac{n}{(n^2 + 2n + 2)(n^2 - 2n + 2)} = \\frac{1}{4} \\left( \\frac{1}{n^2 - 2n + 2} - \\frac{1}{n^2 + 2n + 2} \\right)\n\\]",
